  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Preliminary market consultations",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Finalise and publish procurement pack",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that, before commencing a procurement procedure, contracting authorities may undertake market consultations in order to prepare the procurement and inform suppliers of their procurement plans and requirements.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "As part of such market consultations contracting authorities may, for example, obtain advice from independent experts or authorities or from market participants which may be used in the planning and conduct of the procurement.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Any use of information obtained in market consultations must not have the effect of distorting competition or result in violation of the principles of non-discrimination and transparency.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Appropriate measures should be put in place to ensure that any information gained during preliminary market consultations will not have the effect of distorting competition or, violate the principles of non-discrimination and transparency.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that effective measures are taken to prevent and remedy, as appropriate, any potential distortion of competition or breach of the principles of non-discrimination and / or transparency",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "be mindful of the principles of non-discrimination and transparency during the conduct of preliminary market consultations.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Preliminary market consultations",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
